    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong> ~~\u00a0Welcome ~~</strong></i></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To a surrealistic adventure that inhabits the space between your curiosity and anxiety.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You wake up snowbound at a decrepit inn in the middle of nowhere. Hey, at least you've got a room! Oh, and have you met the concierge? He looks every bit as senescent as this place, but I promise he's a nice man. Acts like he knows you, the old chum. So, who are you again?  </i><br><br><br><i>...More importantly, have you seen any of the other guests around?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/867d4a5617aef1c59b65e4a799300bc4.poster.avif?t=1755204593\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/867d4a5617aef1c59b65e4a799300bc4.webm?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/867d4a5617aef1c59b65e4a799300bc4.mp4?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You will not be told what to do. It's up to you to figure it all out. Shift your perspective.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Parasonik camcorder will help you perceive what the naked eye cannot. Find clues, solve puzzles and seek the supernatural through this special lens. Secrets are scattered throughout every nook and cranny of the inn - you will uncover what is hidden, if you simply dare to look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/a676193ef885036acc878accc2673eda.poster.avif?t=1755204593\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/a676193ef885036acc878accc2673eda.webm?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/a676193ef885036acc878accc2673eda.mp4?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't get comfortable. Your trials are ever-changing. Adaptation is key.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 6 abstract levels with distinct mechanics and artsyles, inspired by classic games and cinema. No tutorials - you'll have to be resilient and trust your intuition to persevere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/412f3878bdda57b67ba2043c6d89300e.poster.avif?t=1755204593\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/412f3878bdda57b67ba2043c6d89300e.webm?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/412f3878bdda57b67ba2043c6d89300e.mp4?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are the engine at the heart of all these enigmas. But what is the connection?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this puzzling story, you are in charge of finding and putting the pieces together. Don't worry if you miss some - you're only human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/8721b19dedeac56b3957b92a7cf715f9.poster.avif?t=1755204593\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/8721b19dedeac56b3957b92a7cf715f9.webm?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/8721b19dedeac56b3957b92a7cf715f9.mp4?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What else?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a mystery that's as otherworldly as it is close to heart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautiful hand-painted rooms dense with  secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonlinear progression: Any way forward is correct.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an unpredictable, genre-agnostic variety of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of unconventional challenges that'll have you thinking outside the box.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mouse controls: Left and right click only, context-sensitive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of hidden achievements, cutscenes and puzzles. You won't find everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can call for help if you get stuck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reading is mostly optional. You are mostly silent.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no monsters. Only people.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet some funny animals with funny animal problems.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong> ~~ Enjoy your stay ~~</strong></i></u></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong> ~~\u00a0Welcome ~~</strong></i></u></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >To a surrealistic adventure that inhabits the space between your curiosity and anxiety.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You wake up snowbound at a decrepit inn in the middle of nowhere. Hey, at least you've got a room! Oh, and have you met the concierge? He looks every bit as senescent as this place, but I promise he's a nice man. Acts like he knows you, the old chum. So, who are you again?  </i><br><br><br><i>...More importantly, have you seen any of the other guests around?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/867d4a5617aef1c59b65e4a799300bc4.poster.avif?t=1755204593\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/867d4a5617aef1c59b65e4a799300bc4.webm?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/867d4a5617aef1c59b65e4a799300bc4.mp4?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You will not be told what to do. It's up to you to figure it all out. Shift your perspective.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Parasonik camcorder will help you perceive what the naked eye cannot. Find clues, solve puzzles and seek the supernatural through this special lens. Secrets are scattered throughout every nook and cranny of the inn - you will uncover what is hidden, if you simply dare to look.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/a676193ef885036acc878accc2673eda.poster.avif?t=1755204593\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/a676193ef885036acc878accc2673eda.webm?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/a676193ef885036acc878accc2673eda.mp4?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't get comfortable. Your trials are ever-changing. Adaptation is key.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through 6 abstract levels with distinct mechanics and artsyles, inspired by classic games and cinema. No tutorials - you'll have to be resilient and trust your intuition to persevere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/412f3878bdda57b67ba2043c6d89300e.poster.avif?t=1755204593\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/412f3878bdda57b67ba2043c6d89300e.webm?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/412f3878bdda57b67ba2043c6d89300e.mp4?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are the engine at the heart of all these enigmas. But what is the connection?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this puzzling story, you are in charge of finding and putting the pieces together. Don't worry if you miss some - you're only human.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/8721b19dedeac56b3957b92a7cf715f9.poster.avif?t=1755204593\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/8721b19dedeac56b3957b92a7cf715f9.webm?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073240/extras/8721b19dedeac56b3957b92a7cf715f9.mp4?t=1755204593\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What else?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a mystery that's as otherworldly as it is close to heart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautiful hand-painted rooms dense with  secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonlinear progression: Any way forward is correct.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an unpredictable, genre-agnostic variety of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of unconventional challenges that'll have you thinking outside the box.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mouse controls: Left and right click only, context-sensitive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of hidden achievements, cutscenes and puzzles. You won't find everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can call for help if you get stuck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reading is mostly optional. You are mostly silent.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no monsters. Only people.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet some funny animals with funny animal problems.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong> ~~ Enjoy your stay ~~</strong></i></u></h2>",
    "short_description": "Concierge is a challenging, suspenseful nonlinear adventure about an old man and an older hotel. Discover your identity and explore your purpose in a surrealistic world of puzzles and trials of every sort. You're on your own - but you are not alone.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201csomewhat unorthodox, focusing on several features not too many modern horror games do.\u201d<br>GameRant<br>",
